Core-Geth is the Ethereum Classic execution client. It supports every Ethereum
Classic hard fork from Frontier through Spiral, and retains the multi-network
configuration model it inherited, in which a further network is a chain
configuration rather than a new client.
https://github.com/ethereumclassic/core-geth

Core-Geth is a fork of go-ethereum (https://github.com/ethereum/go-ethereum)
by way of multi-geth (https://github.com/multi-geth/multi-geth), and is a
derivative work of both. The great majority of this source is theirs; the
copyright header on any given file records which. Their contributors are
listed in AUTHORS, which this project maintains rather than replaces.

